---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="reversion to the mean" description="ai design has a smell. it's the average of everything it saw.">
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div class="font-mono text-xs text-faint mb-4">
      <a href="/writing" class="text-accent hover:underline">writing</a> <span class="text-faint">/</span> reversion-to-the-mean
    </div>

    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-normal animate-fade-up">reversion to the mean</h1>

    <div class="essay mt-10 animate-fade-up delay-1">
      <p>ai design has a smell.</p>

      <p>it's reversion to the mean. every decision drifts back toward the average of everything it saw.</p>

      <hr class="my-12 border-border" />

      <p>what makes design good is the deliberate parts. someone picked that on purpose and could have been wrong.</p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-spice">a model has nothing at stake so it never really picks.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-6 border-t border-border">
      <a href="/writing" class="text-accent hover:underline">← back to writing</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .essay p {
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
</style>
